Next == C!Up \/ C!Back
Spec == Init /\ [][Next]_vars /\ WF_vars(Next)
ReachesThree == <>(x = 3)
====


--- file: scripts/test/corpus/CounterInstance/CounterSteps.tla ---
---- MODULE CounterSteps ----
EXTENDS Naturals
VARIABLE x
Up == x < 2 /\ x' = x + 1
Back == x = 2 /\ x' = 1
====


